From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 18:16:38 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Implement input mode selection in the compose form

- Add input mode state management to the compose reducer
- Create input mode constants and type-guard utilities
- Introduce the InputModeDropdown component for mode selection
- Integrate the dropdown into the main ComposeForm interface
- Ensure input mode resets appropriately on form clearance

Rationale: This change establishes the foundational infrastructure and UI required to support future post-formatting features, allowing users to toggle between different input states within the compose form.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

