From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 04:14:20 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Persist status content type in the database and API

- Add content_type column to statuses and status_edits tables
- Validate content types and provide effective_content_type defaults
- Include content_type in status serialisation and API responses
- Update compose logic to track and convert content type formats
- Sync input mode state during status edits and redrafts

Rationale: This ensures the platform can reliably store and retrieve the format of post content, providing the necessary data structure for future support of diverse media or rich text types while maintaining backward compatibility.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

